codex
The root cause is the container’s nested PID namespace: Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, while this container exposes host-PID entries; `/proc/self/exe` remains valid. I’m using a narrowly scoped read-only compatibility shim that redirects only `/proc/<digits>/exe` lookups to `/proc/self/exe`. It does not alter Lean source, proof terms, project files, or theorem checking.
