+
+   Normalized hash
+   `9da3d0e2a43f2a59d88512067068ed2de6ddc5b6972e73b0a57e10a6e46fc33d`;
+   identity
+   `rule-9da3d0e2a43f2a59d88512067068ed2de6ddc5b6972e73b0a57e10a6e46fc33d`.
+
+2. Lines 10–12:
