+
+The unique fixed target is:
+
+- declaration: `Klean57Monotonic.Lemmas.targetStatement`;
+- statement:
+  `Klean57Monotonic.Lemmas.targetStatement _orBool_ «_==Bool_» notBool_`;
+- definition hash:
